# Chinese Audio Practice Generator

## Project Overview

A Python web app that generates MP3 audio files of Chinese dialogue conversations
using edge-tts, with different male/female voices per speaker. Built for a beginner
Mandarin learner (lessons 1-5).

## How to Run

```bash
# Activate virtual environment
source venv/bin/activate

# Web UI (paste and generate)
python app.py
# Opens http://localhost:5000

# Batch CLI (generate all 16 pre-built conversations)
python generate_all.py
python generate_all.py --rate=-15%   # slower for beginners
python generate_all.py --only=01     # just one conversation
```

## Project Structure

- `app.py` — Flask web server (main entry point for web UI)
- `tts_engine.py` — Core TTS logic: parse_dialogue, detect_speakers, generate_audio
- `conversations.py` — 16 pre-built conversations (used by CLI batch generator)
- `generate_all.py` — CLI batch generator for all pre-built conversations
- `templates/index.html` — Web UI (single page, loads with a default dialogue)
- `output/` — Generated MP3 files (auto-created)
- `render.yaml` — Render deployment config (Blueprint spec)
- `requirements.txt` — edge-tts, flask, gunicorn, imageio-ffmpeg, pypinyin
- `venv/` — Python virtual environment

## Deployment

The app is deployed on Render (free tier).

- **Live URL**: https://chinese-audio-practice.onrender.com
- **Config**: `render.yaml` (Blueprint spec — auto-detected by Render)
- **WSGI server**: gunicorn (`gunicorn app:app`)
- **Auto-deploy**: Pushes to the main branch on GitHub trigger a redeploy
- **Cold starts**: Free tier spins down after 15 min of inactivity; first request takes ~30s

## Adding New Conversations

Edit `conversations.py` and add a new dict to the CONVERSATIONS list:

```python
{
    "id": "17",
    "name": "your_name_here",
    "description": "Short description",
    "lines": [
        ("售货员", "您好！"),
        ("顾客", "我要一瓶水。"),
    ],
}
```

Then run `python generate_all.py --only=17` to generate the audio.

## Paste Format for Web UI

```
售货员：您好！您要什么？
顾客：我要两件T恤。
```

Both Chinese colon (：) and ASCII colon (:) are supported.

## Web UI Features

- **Show Pinyin**: Toggle button overlays pinyin with tone marks above each Chinese character inline in the text panel. Applies tone sandhi rules (3rd+3rd, 一, 不) and highlights changed tones in amber.
- **Select-to-Translate**: Select any word(s) in the textarea or pinyin overlay to see an instant English translation tooltip. Pinyin annotations are stripped so only characters are sent for translation.
- **Voice Assignment**: Auto-detects speakers and lets you pick male/female voices for each.
- **Speed Slider**: Adjust speech rate from -50% to +50%.

## Available Voices

- zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural — female, natural (default for 1st speaker)
- zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural — female, young
- zh-CN-YunxiNeural — male, natural (default for 2nd speaker)
- zh-CN-YunyangNeural — male, broadcast (default for narrator/旁白)
- zh-CN-YunjianNeural — male, sporty
- zh-CN-YunxiaNeural — male, boyish

## Complete Vocabulary Reference (Lessons 1-5)

### Numbers
零-十, 十一-九十九, 一百-九百九十九 (with 零 rule: 一百零二)

### Measure Words
瓶 (bottle), 盒 (box), 听 (can), 个 (general), 双 (pair), 件 (clothing), 顶 (hat), 块 (bar), 条 (pants)

### Money
块/元 (yuan), 毛 (0.1 yuan), 分 (0.01 yuan)

### Verbs
买, 要, 给, 找, 是

### Pronouns
我, 你, 您, 他, 她, 它 + 们

### Demonstratives
这/那 + MW + noun; 这个, 那个

### People
售货员, 顾客, 师傅

### Greetings
你好, 您好, 你好吗, 我很好, 你呢, 晚安, 再见, 谢谢, 生日快乐

### Shopping Phrases
多少钱, 一共, 还要别的吗, 不要了, 扫码还是现金, 现金

### Food/Drink
可乐, 牛奶, 水, 矿泉水, 三明治, 面包, 鸡蛋, 巧克力, 方便面, 水果, 冰棍, 鸡肉, 牛肉

### Clothing
鞋, T恤, 帽子, 裤子, 袜子

### Toiletries
肥皂, 纸巾, 牙刷, 洗发水, 浴液, 毛巾

### Other Nouns
礼物, 钱, 汽油, 东西

### Currencies
美元, 欧元, 日元, 韩币, 泰铢

### Adverbs/Adjectives
很, 好, 经常, 大一点儿, 小一点儿

### Sentence Patterns
我要买..., X多少钱？, 一共...钱, 给您..., 找您..., 我经常买..., 这是..., 我是...
